'''Korblox''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is black with textured creases on it. The tip of the blade is blue, which runs down the blade to the heel. The guard is silver, and the handle is purple with silver outlines. The pommel of the handle is silver with a wave pattern imprinted on it.

== Trivia ==
*It derives from ROBLOX’s [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Korblox_(series) Korblox Series].
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [http://www.roblox.com/Korblox-item?id=315501501 here].
